Note on bundled binaries

This repository contains scripts only. The runtime dependencies downloaded by
fetch-deps.ps1 are separate works with their own licenses:

  ffmpeg  - GPL v3 (the builds used here are configured with --enable-gpl)
            https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html
  VLC     - GPL v2 or later
            https://www.videolan.org/legal.html

They are downloaded at install time and are not part of this repository, so
anyone redistributing a package that includes them must comply with those
licenses on their own.
